---
/**
 * Quote.astro — scripture mirror section for /.
 */
---
<section class="h-quote-section h-reveal" aria-label="Эпиграф">
  <div class="h-ornament" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>

  <div class="h-quote-mirror">
    <div class="h-quote-left">
      <blockquote class="h-blockquote h-blockquote--mirror">
        Господь Бог — сила моя: Он сделает ноги мои как у оленя и на высоты мои возведёт меня.
      </blockquote>
      <cite class="h-cite h-cite--mirror">— Аввакум 3:19</cite>
    </div>

    <div class="h-quote-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="h-quote-right">
      <div class="h-sacred-block h-sacred-block--mirror" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation">
        <span class="h-sacred-line h-sacred-line--1">
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">יְהוִה</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">Яхве</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">אֲדֹנָי</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">Господь</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">חֵילִי</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">сила моя</span>
          </span>
        </span>

        <span class="h-sacred-line h-sacred-line--2">
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">וַיָּשֶׂם</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">и сделает</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">רַגְלַי</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">ноги мои</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">כָּאַיָּלוֹת</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">как у ланей</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">וְעַל</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">и на</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">בָּמוֹתַי</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">высоты мои</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hb-w">
            <span class="hb-front" lang="he">יַדְרִכֵנִי</span>
            <span class="hb-back" aria-hidden="true">даст мне ступать</span>
          </span>
        </span>

        <span class="h-sacred-ref h-sacred-ref--mirror">
          <span>Аввакум 3:19</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="h-ornament" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-top:28px;">✦</div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  /* This lower mirror is decorative: the full Russian quotation already sits
     beside it, so reduced-motion must never superimpose translation backs over
     the Hebrew letterforms. */
  body.home-page #main-content .h-sacred-block--mirror .hb-front {
    visibility: visible;
    opacity: .82 !important;
  }

  body.home-page #main-content .h-sacred-block--mirror .hb-back {
    visibility: hidden;
    opacity: 0 !important;
  }
</style>
